---
/**
 * Node-and-edge background behind the homepage hero (owner's request),
 * styled after the network background on the owner's previous portfolio.
 *
 * - One inline SVG, generated once by a seeded script and committed as
 *   static markup. It reads as a graph net rather than a web because of:
 *   - Clusters: 130 nodes, most scattered around a few centres, leaving
 *     emptier areas between, placed only where the mask shows them, plus
 *     16 at the very top-right corner so the net starts in the corner on
 *     phones too (in portrait only the canvas's right edge is visible).
 *   - Two layers of links: each node links to up to 6 neighbours within
 *     360 units. The 3 nearest are bright; the rest are faint long links
 *     whose opacity falls with distance.
 *   - Depth: each node has a depth; nearer nodes are bigger (about 2.5-5.5px)
 *     and brighter, and links fade with their farther node.
 *   Faint links are drawn first so bright ones sit on top. Each line's
 *   data-n holds its two node indices so the drift script can move its ends.
 * - 1px round-capped lines that stay 1px at any size (non-scaling-stroke).
 *   The whole layer sits at 85%. Colour: bright blue, via currentColor.
 * - "xMaxYMin slice" anchors the top-right corner and scales the canvas to
 *   cover any screen. A radial mask keeps it strongest at the top right and
 *   fades it out before the headline, so the text stays fully readable.
 * - Slow drift: each node floats on its own gentle path (about 5-15px
 *   either way over 15-30s; nearer, bigger nodes move more, for a slight
 *   parallax) and its lines follow. A small requestAnimationFrame
 *   loop (no library) runs only while the hero is on screen and the tab is
 *   visible; with reduced motion it never starts and the static markup
 *   stays as is.
 * - Decorative: aria-hidden, pointer-events: none, behind the content
 *   (Section's background slot isolates the section; this layer is z -1).
 */
---

<svg
  class="hero-network pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 size-full text-bright"
  viewBox="0 0 1600 1000"
  preserveAspectRatio="xMaxYMin slice"
  aria-hidden="true"
  focusable="false"
>
  <g class="net-lines" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round">
